# My AI news digest - 9 November 2026

## Open-source toolkit adds offline speech recognition
A community-maintained open-source toolkit released version 2.0, adding speech recognition that works without a network connection, supporting 12 languages and running on a laptop CPU, according to its maintainers.
Source: Example Wire - https://example.com/wire/offline-speech-toolkit?utm_source=rss
